'''Coal''' is a [[Common Weapons|common]] knife that was originally obtainable by purchasing the 2nd tier in the Lumber Yard during the [[Christmas Event 2018|2018 Christmas Event]]. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended.

==Appearance==
Coal has a rocky grey texture as its blade. Its guard is also the same, with its handle being a solid black color.

==Trivia== 
*It has a [[Coal Gun (2018)|partner gun]] under the same name.
*Its decal, published by [[didi1147]] on December 22, 2018, can be found [https://www.roblox.com/library/2669120353/Coal-Knife1 here].
* There was a bug where if players equipped the [[Knifeception]] effect with this knife, small images of [[Slime (Knife)]]’s decal would appear. However, this has since been patched.

